    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an apple. <br>No, not a metaphor. You are truly an apple. <br>Red, shiny, vibrant skin; full and ripe inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no movement in this game. No jumping. No enemies. <br>You simply exist. You stay still. You think. <br>You\u2019re being watched\u2026 perhaps studied.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, the play of light paints your skin in shifting colors. <br>But still, you remain\u2026 just an apple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And maybe, that means more than you think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can being an apple be a game? <br>Can stillness be an action? <br>Can being observed be a challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We believe it can. <br>And this game exists for exactly that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We leave you with just one question: <br>Can you truly remain\u2026 an apple?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an apple. <br>No, not a metaphor. You are truly an apple. <br>Red, shiny, vibrant skin; full and ripe inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no movement in this game. No jumping. No enemies. <br>You simply exist. You stay still. You think. <br>You\u2019re being watched\u2026 perhaps studied.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, the play of light paints your skin in shifting colors. <br>But still, you remain\u2026 just an apple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And maybe, that means more than you think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can being an apple be a game? <br>Can stillness be an action? <br>Can being observed be a challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We believe it can. <br>And this game exists for exactly that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We leave you with just one question: <br>Can you truly remain\u2026 an apple?</p>",
    "short_description": "You are an apple. Truly. Red, shiny, alive. No movement. You just stay still. You're being observed. Sometimes, the light changes you. But you're always the same: an apple. So, can just standing still... be a game? There\u2019s no movement in this game. No jumping. No enemies. You simply exist.",
